{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>當年憑美心蘿蔔糕廣告走紅全港的「美心妹妹」楊鎧凝（Celine），轉眼間已由稚氣的小童星蛻變為18歲的美少女。目前在日本九州著名寄宿制高中就讀的她，近日趁放暑假與家人飛往泰國曼谷旅遊度假，並在社交平台分享多張靚相，其中一張泳裝照更引起網民熱議。</p><figure><img alt=\"5歲的「美心妹妹」楊鎧凝小妹妹（Celine）好可愛！（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200827/375703826767941632.jpeg/KzjSUEeTSXOeV04wmbtIPnUsdIkLEfD4DKmT5gypk-Y\"/><figcaption>5歲的「美心妹妹」楊鎧凝小妹妹（Celine）好可愛！（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊鎧凝細個係「廣告小天后」。（facebook@Celine 楊鎧凝﻿）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260329/1115009826020134912529381.png/Abtrguf0DMUjPXTS9g7_X2kUqy8rlWqElaOcHZWjnB0\"/><figcaption>楊鎧凝細個係「廣告小天后」。（facebook@Celine 楊鎧凝﻿）</figcaption></figure><p>「美心妹妹」楊鎧凝遊泰罕有曬泳裝照</p><p>在楊鎧凝連日來在IG分享在的照片，身在曼谷的她除了享受美食之外，還穿上泳裝享受日光浴，並發文寫道：「喺泰國緊係游水enjoy sunshine 啦！」相中楊鎧凝穿上一襲黑白色，配有荷葉邊及白色喱士的兩件頭泳裝。楊鎧凝盤起丸子頭，對鏡頭展現招牌甜美笑容，活力十足的她仍然保留童顏，今次罕有曬健康小性感，引來大批網民大讚：「靚靚妹妹 🥰」、「好靚呀個笑容」、「皮膚好白淨呀 又靚女😍」、「女大十八變」。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊鎧凝遊泰罕有曬泳裝照。（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170727683223719936761520.png/wppX7P0t2ISsuCGmuyKx7aGAgY41rWwCGJXv9BiV7_Q\"/><figcaption>楊鎧凝遊泰罕有曬泳裝照。（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"目前在日本九州著名寄宿制高中就讀的Celine，近日趁放暑假與家人飛往泰國曼谷旅遊度假。（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170727680610537472427638.png/T2GmjIcdgAbbN91_l82y_yeWUsG7y9aPB4qQNQeKkDU\"/><figcaption>目前在日本九州著名寄宿制高中就讀的Celine，近日趁放暑假與家人飛往泰國曼谷旅遊度假。（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Celine依然極童顏。（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170727677812805632471853.png/4J3YQYPsEf7NO9t7MRq2lpyWrtfWtNET-mXY5vpl2OY\"/><figcaption>Celine依然極童顏。（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女大十八變！（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170730783753768960079315.jpeg/iiBrrSRmswlEBMALZFFrHTqN4GMzdfrAJKd0miSndJo\"/><figcaption>女大十八變！（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Celine活力十足！（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260830/1170730781035728896471206.jpeg/8PQiwPiPbWDUolNXXOTzdS2VV_aT8kzMdO9NLXTvTS0\"/><figcaption>Celine活力十足！（IG/@celineyeunghongkong）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T09:38:09.199969+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":626,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}